When you post questions in the future, please provide as much
information as possible on what you are doing, especially the commands
you are calling.

While trying to be Dr Watson, is it correct if I guess you are trying
to load a chip-effect set, without "redoing" the complete CRMAv2
script?  If so, there are more explanations for what you are
observing.

>
>> head(ces[100000]);

Don't use the subset functions, e.g. ces[10000].  That is a very
low-level access to data.  I assume you found this by trial and error,
but please let me know if there is a page/document "out there" that
says you should do so - then I should fix/remove it.

