>> > <environment>,  :
>>
>> > [2010-03-09 16:38:21] Exception: Argument 'cdf' is neither of nor
>> > inherits class AffymetrixCdfFile: character

This one is because you used findByChipType() above; use byChipType()
and it will work.

Hope this helps

Henrik

