Hi Henrik,

Here is a simplified script that I tested to go from CEL file to limma
MA plot.  Attached are the png files shown in the script.
sessionInfo() is shown below.

The png files are:

These first three png files show the "usual" way to do RMA normalization;

Anderson rat ST raw intensity all probes rmaBG QN 27mar10.png
